# ==============================================================================
# VetVision AI — Frontend Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# IMPORTANT:
# Vite embeds environment variables prefixed with VITE_ into the static client
# bundle at BUILD TIME (during `npm run build`). Setting this variable at runtime
# on a static server (Vercel, Netlify, Nginx) will NOT update an already-built bundle.
#
# LOCAL DEVELOPMENT:
# In local development, you can leave this empty or commented out.
# Vite's dev server (`npm run dev`) automatically proxies requests from `/api`
# to the local Flask backend at http://127.0.0.1:5000.
#
# PRODUCTION DEPLOYMENT:
# Set this to the public URL of your deployed VetVision AI backend API.
# The client automatically ensures the `/api/v1` segment is present without duplicates.
# Example:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://vetvision-backend.onrender.com/api/v1
# Or simply:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://vetvision-backend.onrender.com
# ==============================================================================

VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1
